                    {
                        "sense_id": "b7cb538b-98d0-33a6-bdc1-5e5b4648298d",
                        "entry_id": "50c2ef97-40e8-3273-9095-d933de81ef15",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Not marriageable, unsuitable for marriage."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d455dc9d-363a-4156-9aca-39723bef40d9",
                                "sense_id": "b7cb538b-98d0-33a6-bdc1-5e5b4648298d",
                                "text": "You have always had a little way of alluding to her as an unmarriageable girl."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1ee9e181-399f-4d53-98d2-575e277840b7",
                                "sense_id": "b7cb538b-98d0-33a6-bdc1-5e5b4648298d",
                                "text": "He had a way of pronouncing the word \"miss\" that made it an epithet, a sneer at her unmarried and unmarriageable state."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "13cedf63-ef74-3a19-9696-0ef85706b678",
                        "entry_id": "50c2ef97-40e8-3273-9095-d933de81ef15",
                        "glosses": [
                            "That cannot be reconciled, inconsistent."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "356a8ef1-914f-485d-8706-5b9a160c11f9",
                                "sense_id": "13cedf63-ef74-3a19-9696-0ef85706b678",
                                "text": "A link was wanting between two craving parts of nature, and he was hurled into being as the bridge over that yawning need, the mediator betwixt two else unmarriageable facts."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "06372184-0a04-4fe0-8749-635612911e40",
                                "sense_id": "13cedf63-ef74-3a19-9696-0ef85706b678",
                                "text": "[…] which is a very curious cross between two things that at first sight may seem unmarriageable, the Wordsworthian enthusiasm and the Byronic despair."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
